Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.28,0:00:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.42,0:00:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.96,0:00:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that can't be beaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.02,0:00:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past every wall that's\Nin our wake, go without hesitation!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.78,0:00:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.86,0:00:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We just have to press on a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.70,0:00:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,To get to the answers we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We came to this new world believing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.38,0:00:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That surely someday we\Njust might find the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.04,0:00:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All the pieces of our dreams\Nhave now come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.98,0:00:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Our bonds won't waver.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.38,0:00:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,With our dreaming hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on towards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.66,0:00:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A bright new future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.78,0:00:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.62,0:00:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.68,0:01:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.30,0:01:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that you believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.48,0:01:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past everyone that's in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.40,0:01:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on never stopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.68,0:01:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.42,0:01:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your head up way up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.42,0:01:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Always step up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.12,0:01:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If waves are rough, jump to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.08,0:01:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Never give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.88,0:01:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Our wishes, they will come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.84,0:01:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And lead us on for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.68,0:01:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We drift on riding the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.92,0:01:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Towards another shore day by day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.80,0:01:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There are many meetings, many goodbyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.58,0:01:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Underneath the flag we fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.06,0:01:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll remember the pain within.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep it in my heart forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.94,0:01:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And never take it lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.06,0:01:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But I won't surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.92,0:01:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This freedom I will keep in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.12,0:01:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep holding on, never stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.72,0:01:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.52,0:01:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.60,0:02:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.24,0:02:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that you believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.42,0:02:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.96,0:02:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past everyone that's in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.32,0:02:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on, never stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.76,0:02:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up, keep your\Nhead up way up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.40,0:02:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Always step up, if brains\Nare rubbed up to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.02,0:02:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Never give up, our wishes\Nthey will come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.76,0:02:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And lead us on for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.14,0:02:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.64,0:02:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.30,0:02:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,God!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.21,0:02:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That's way too many!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.20,0:02:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.02,0:02:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Legs full! Boot! Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.50,0:02:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No more legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.52,0:02:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Devil Fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.38,0:02:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.96,0:02:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I know just the thing for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.20,0:02:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Now fire! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.14,0:03:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Aim right for the bottom of their vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.70,0:03:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's turn back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.46,0:03:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I would ever do that, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.44,0:03:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Go forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.04,0:03:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.28,0:03:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you not notice the nonstop gunfire?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.66,0:03:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.76,0:03:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We're this close to\Nsinking to a watery calf!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.04,0:03:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.80,0:03:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never escape the wrath\Nof Brownbeard, you fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.52,0:03:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the former pirate with a\Nbounty of over 80 million berries!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.32,0:03:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.70,0:03:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But you won't forget this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.32,0:03:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! He got us! We're falling!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.66,0:03:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.16,0:03:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha! That's all it, teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.22,0:04:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Real nice shot there, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.52,0:04:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They're dead meat now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.22,0:04:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It serves you right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.30,0:04:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Struggling won't help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.30,0:04:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon you'll all freeze\Nand think like rots.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.66,0:04:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So cold. It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.14,0:04:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna be the snow cones. This blows.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.76,0:04:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all your fault, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.34,0:04:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We could have got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.06,0:04:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But, oh, you just had to keep on\Nputting his butt in, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.06,0:04:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.14,0:04:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even talk now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.04,0:04:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.88,0:04:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess they won't join\Nthe crew after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.78,0:04:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, finish them off!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.48,0:04:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, here's what we'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.80,0:04:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You stay and keep them from drowning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.34,0:04:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get slicing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.72,0:04:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.20,0:04:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Make it quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.62,0:04:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.44,0:04:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll just take a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.32,0:05:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.56,0:05:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.82,0:05:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are there sharks in a lake?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.70,0:05:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.96,0:05:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not a lake. It's a sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.20,0:05:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The battle between Akainu and Aokiji was\Nso explosive, it left a massive crater.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.00,0:05:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Water from the sea\Npoured in through cracks
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.36,0:05:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,in the island and made what you see here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.60,0:05:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It brought plenty of\Nsea life along with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.24,0:05:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, no, no kidding, Zoro,\Nalso hurry, I'm cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.88,0:05:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Aim and fire, there's\Nnowhere they can go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.04,0:05:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hate to say it, but he's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.12,0:05:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Send them straight to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.14,0:06:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,After all the crazy crap I've lived through,\Nthis is the thing that's gonna kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.88,0:06:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now meet your maker!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.60,0:06:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.38,0:06:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,My soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.74,0:06:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What just happened to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.38,0:06:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.10,0:06:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Colder than a blizzard,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.76,0:06:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,the wind from the underworld\Ncuts like an icy blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.08,0:06:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.50,0:06:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.02,0:06:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, I just froze your gun barrels,\Nso I would advise against shooting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.58,0:06:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless you want them to explode, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.46,0:06:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.72,0:06:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And why the skeleton disguise?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.82,0:07:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is of no consequence. It's Brook.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.38,0:07:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Make up your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.76,0:07:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I died once and became a skeleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.50,0:07:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And now that I live again, my second\Nlife is devoted to the Straw Hat crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.04,0:07:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You can call me the Soul King.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.08,0:07:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how you froze our guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.34,0:07:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But... you'll pay! Pay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.66,0:07:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And how do you plan to make me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.82,0:07:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard! That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.98,0:07:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I've lost enough friends\Nin my time, so I say...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.82,0:07:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.32,0:07:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.66,0:07:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so fast, it's scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.26,0:07:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They beat up the Sharks?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.66,0:07:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.57,0:07:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did those wretched pirates go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.32,0:07:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.96,0:08:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a pleasant surprise, Brooke!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.66,0:08:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so good to see you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.78,0:08:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knew running from\Nthat terrifying ghost
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.54,0:08:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,would lead me directly to where you were?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.02,0:08:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Centaurs, dragons, sharks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.86,0:08:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care what this\Nisland throws at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.44,0:08:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have run\Nwhile you had the chance,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.78,0:08:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,because you sure as hell can't stop us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.38,0:08:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But this damn weather,\Nthat's another thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.42,0:08:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't cut that with\Nmy sword. It's freezing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.54,0:08:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I can barely walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.32,0:08:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you guys, don't you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.46,0:08:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't just go to the cold\Nside like this, I said, but no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.32,0:08:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.84,0:08:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If you ask me, we got lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.44,0:08:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Running into them was the best\Nthing that could have happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.32,0:08:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,They're close.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.34,0:08:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's open fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.06,0:08:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.10,0:08:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I've seen them before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.78,0:08:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Good thinking, Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.72,0:09:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I called the fourth guy from the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.76,0:09:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, nice one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.38,0:09:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take the guy next to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.94,0:09:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, now, let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.22,0:09:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The girl on the far left will do nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.34,0:09:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.25,0:09:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.04,0:09:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Those coats look nice and warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.26,0:09:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.18,0:09:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But please get me wiped out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.92,0:09:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, they're not going to\Ntake our clothes, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.24,0:09:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, then we'll freeze to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.46,0:09:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember now, that Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.88,0:09:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, from two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.96,0:09:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That came from the worst generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.36,0:09:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.84,0:09:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Firefist's brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.52,0:09:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The pirates draw at Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.54,0:10:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,With a 400 million bounty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.12,0:10:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.10,0:10:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna kill us all
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.82,0:10:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't hurt me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.00,0:10:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.14,0:10:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's karate chop our way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.48,0:10:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's that back door?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.24,0:10:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold your treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.54,0:10:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We mustn't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.10,0:10:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That fellow back there was the\None that cut my body into three.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.40,0:10:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.31,0:10:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.23,0:10:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So, do you think he might still\Nhave the rest of you? On hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.70,0:10:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I highly doubt he would. Okay,\Nthen. It can wait. Take me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.20,0:10:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I can obtain some information.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.34,0:10:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The only relevant information right now\Nis that we need to run the hell away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.66,0:10:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.50,0:10:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.00,0:11:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not letting them get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.62,0:11:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Room.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.52,0:11:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you guys just see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.56,0:11:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The air is all perky.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.74,0:11:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, shambles.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.52,0:11:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.43,0:11:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I just felt something weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.84,0:11:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No time to think about it right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.40,0:11:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep moving! rug rats!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.20,0:11:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The exit can't be far!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.56,0:11:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.70,0:11:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My cigarette go
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.90,0:11:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,super
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.06,0:12:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,close to!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.48,0:12:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,busting our way out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.78,0:12:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.69,0:12:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Good thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.61,0:12:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I got these Tribe power!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.52,0:12:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Tank transit crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.64,0:12:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're acting really weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.88,0:12:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,that ability is way too powerful! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.16,0:12:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy really creeps me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.94,0:12:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.44,0:12:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,None of you are going anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.68,0:12:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He turned our ship into\Nabstract art! It's a wreck!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.28,0:12:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't take that out to sea! I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.86,0:12:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We're stuck on this crappy\Nisland with that lunatic!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.72,0:12:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You work for the government too, bud!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.82,0:12:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And just now, you broke\Ncontract by causing us trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.54,0:12:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, cut it out, Law!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.04,0:12:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait till we tell HQ!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.74,0:12:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna lose your title!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.90,0:12:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,See how much I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.14,0:12:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now scan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.54,0:12:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that do? Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.76,0:13:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.67,0:13:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Transponder snails?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.59,0:13:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I lost mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.46,0:13:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, so did I!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.58,0:13:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you stole them, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.04,0:13:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Give those back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.28,0:13:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you need them for, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.52,0:13:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let you reveal what\Nyou've seen on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.40,0:13:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This way, the government\Nnever has to hear about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.02,0:13:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Warlord or not, you've\Npushed your luck too far now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.46,0:13:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The abob fruit, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.58,0:13:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see what it's made of.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.72,0:13:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him cut you, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.50,0:13:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stay away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.80,0:13:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He's happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.48,0:13:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.44,0:13:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.08,0:14:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Get outside of the circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.60,0:14:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what circle?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.32,0:14:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, as long as you're in this vicinity,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.72,0:14:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,you're like a patient\Non an operating table.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.82,0:14:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Law is the surgeon of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.24,0:14:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He can control anything within\Nhis operating room at will.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.32,0:14:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll end you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.44,0:14:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Trafalgar Law!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.36,0:14:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You've left me no choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.58,0:14:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop to see him! You can't win!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.96,0:14:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Your hockey's too weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.02,0:14:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.82,0:14:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.84,0:14:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You cut her clean in\Nhalf, you sick bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.70,0:14:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, uh, you're still alive, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.26,0:14:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.10,0:15:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.01,0:15:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Flying here in pieces, cut\Ndown but left to live in shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.72,0:15:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won't you finish me, Trafalgar?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.98,0:15:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You may wield a sword, but\Ndon't act like you're a master.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.38,0:15:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Honor is something that\Nyou earn, not beg for.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.02,0:15:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Weaklings like you don't get\Nto choose where they die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.64,0:15:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.55,0:15:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Your sword can't even reach me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.02,0:15:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.62,0:15:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You still want to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.28,0:15:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I can chop you up some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.34,0:15:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.42,0:16:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If you lay another finger on\Nour captain, we'll mess you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.62,0:16:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, captain, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.38,0:16:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see how cocky this bastard\Nis after we fill him with land!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.30,0:16:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.94,0:16:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How is he shooting at us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.44,0:16:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see any gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.72,0:16:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We shot him and he didn't even bunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.80,0:16:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You shot at yourselves,\Nyou bunch of imbeciles.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.50,0:16:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I switched your bullets\Nwith the falling snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.00,0:16:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.91,0:16:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, he's cheating!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.83,0:16:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That isn't fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.54,0:16:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.60,0:16:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll take your head clean off, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.70,0:16:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He cut a damn ship in half!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.34,0:16:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't stop this guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.56,0:16:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He's too strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.94,0:16:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of there, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.84,0:16:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.26,0:16:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.17,0:16:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Smokey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.64,0:17:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You may be a warlord, but\Nyou're still just a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.50,0:17:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That weapon you're swinging around,\Nit's tipped with sea prism stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.38,0:17:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I could feel it in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.96,0:17:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,His ice sculpture!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.38,0:17:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean our ship is coming down!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.74,0:17:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that's our cue to run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.36,0:17:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't fight him anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.12,0:17:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We got no business here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.48,0:17:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.72,0:17:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing we can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.08,0:17:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.16,0:17:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, we're\Ndead weight right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.90,0:17:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Weight blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.52,0:17:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of the circle!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.94,0:17:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of the circle!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.02,0:18:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That noise sure was loud, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.64,0:18:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet it was Saint.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.14,0:18:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Krakatar, you still don't want to\Ntell me where the rest of my crew is at?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.32,0:18:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep dreaming, but you're not gonna\Nget a word out of me, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.66,0:18:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta get to that big building\Nbefore someone gets hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.80,0:18:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.84,0:18:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Or my crew you robbed?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.96,0:18:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a bunch of thugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.04,0:18:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And now you gotta humiliate me like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.56,0:18:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Man up, man-a-dial, crack-o-man, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.82,0:18:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Brooke, you don't even have skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.56,0:18:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're sitting there shivering,\Nbut you can't be cold, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.34,0:18:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you just steal that coat\Nbecause you wanted to fit in?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.94,0:18:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.18,0:18:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been able to keep ourselves warm,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.10,0:18:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,but I fear the others\Nmight not be so fortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.54,0:18:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If they get frostbite, they\Ncould lose any number of limbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.58,0:18:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.64,0:18:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Just spare us your\Ngruesome concerns, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.54,0:19:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.66,0:19:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Law and Smoker are having\Nan Alto battle outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.88,0:19:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Law has made a nuisance of himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.48,0:19:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He was supposed to make\Nthem leave peacefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.08,0:19:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, the pirates took the children from\Nthe biscuit room with them to the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.48,0:19:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They ran into Law, but it doesn't look\Nlike they're part of the struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.00,0:19:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, that means that the Navy\Nsaw the children? Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.34,0:19:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the last thing I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.14,0:19:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They might not know what, but now\Nthey know we're up to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.98,0:19:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,At this point, even if we kill Smoker,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.52,0:19:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,the Navy will only send more\NMarines to investigate us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.74,0:19:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.76,0:19:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you have something helpful\Nto contribute to this, Monet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.18,0:19:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I know who our intruders are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.16,0:19:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind, Smoker.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.46,0:19:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We should have kept a\Ntartar leash on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.20,0:19:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.36,0:19:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I neglected to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.38,0:19:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,They already took out Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.00,0:20:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk's dragon, as well as\NBrownbeard's centaur patrol unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.48,0:20:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They did what? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.46,0:20:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The people that you kidnapped\Nweren't their only crew members,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.76,0:20:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,just the only crew members on the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.86,0:20:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest had already set\Noff for the Burning Lands.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.44,0:20:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They've since crossed the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.38,0:20:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I imagine they'll be here any minute now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.48,0:20:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.39,0:20:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,At least we know who we're\Ndealing with. You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.82,0:20:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no doubting it's them, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.52,0:20:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The faces match.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.66,0:20:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.42,0:20:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So long, ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.76,0:20:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no fixing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.06,0:20:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Got your legs back yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.20,0:20:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not in any pain now, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.76,0:20:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you got a foot on\Nyour wrist there, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.78,0:20:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna want to take care of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.30,0:20:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.21,0:20:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, geez, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.40,0:20:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even know who\Nthis foot belongs to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.48,0:20:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.39,0:20:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't even contact HQ anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.54,0:20:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're stranded on this\Ncrappy island! Law's a jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.64,0:20:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought the warlords were on our side!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.56,0:21:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one thing you always\Nneed to remember, Toshiki.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.68,0:21:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,A pirate's a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.08,0:21:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where they\Ngo, they never change.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.30,0:21:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,All warlords are the same. He was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.78,0:21:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This plan must be why you joined up\Nwith the seven warlords, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.50,0:21:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But what the hell are you after?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.60,0:22:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.98,0:22:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never been a fan\Nof the Warlord system.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.56,0:22:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirates can't be trusted\Nno matter who they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.90,0:22:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You got that one right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.84,0:23:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something big going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.96,0:23:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're only part of it—who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.00,0:23:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's running this show? First.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.68,0:23:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,First
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.76,0:23:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your story?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.30,0:23:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.90,0:23:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to get to\Nthe bottom of something,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.16,0:24:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,then you've got to broaden your\Nhorizons, or you'll miss the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.50,0:24:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Scalpel.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.14,0:24:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.64,0:24:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You can beg, but I don't have\Nto tell you a damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.78,0:25:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
